      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHORELINE DREAM (6) has had eight weeks off since he was beaten 2 metres into third here last start but was kept up to the mark with a nice trial. Won two of his previous four starts at this circuit and distance, both from wider draws than this. Top chance. CONCILIATE (4) comes through the Vicbred Super Series where she was fourth in the heats before drawing on the back row in both her semi and in the final. Went into that series off a Newcastle win. She'll enjoy the class drop. RUMOUR STRIDE (2) backs up after coming from wider to score at Newcastle last Friday. She can be competitive again from the good draw. BLISSES BEST (3) won from this barrier here last month and has finished runner-up in two of three attempts since so respect.",
